    (1, None, '\'Did you bring the complete order of black caviar?\' "Chyornoy ikry", "of black caviar", changes both words: "chyornaya ikra" becomes "chyornoy ikry". "Prinyos" is "you brought". Barinov says "ty" to the supplier.'),
