    (6, None, '\'This is the freshest caviar in all of Moscow.\' "Samaya svezhaya", "the most fresh", is how you say "the freshest". "Vo vsey Moskve" is "in all of Moscow": "vsya Moskva" becomes "vsey Moskve" after "vo".'),
